{"id":"151356","name":"赛泡菜","author":"糖芯厨房","authorId":"730571","desc":"","cover":"images/151356/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红辣椒","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"食醋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材；白萝卜、红辣椒","img":"images/151356/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"白萝卜洗净去皮切厚度大约0.3厘米的大片。","img":"images/151356/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切好的白萝卜放入碗内，加入一大勺食盐。","img":"images/151356/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用手不停捏揉萝卜片，至萝卜片柔软。","img":"images/151356/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"捏到萝卜片能轻松卷起就可以了。","img":"images/151356/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"用清水洗去大部分咸味。","img":"images/151356/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"洗去咸味的萝卜片攥干水分。","img":"images/151356/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"红椒切丁。","img":"images/151356/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入两大勺白糖。","img":"images/151356/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入白醋拌匀。","img":"images/151356/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"腌制十分钟入味即可。","img":"images/151356/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}